			},
			solution: {
				'index.html': `<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>{{title}}</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header" id="top">
      <p class="brand">{{name}}</p>
      <nav aria-label="Site sections">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="#sec-1">{{sections.0}}</a></li>
          <li><a href="#sec-2">{{sections.1}}</a></li>
          <li><a href="#sec-3">{{sections.2}}</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <h1>{{name}}</h1>
      <p>{{who}}</p>
      <p><a class="button" href="#inquiry">{{mainAction.label}}</a></p>

      <section id="sec-1">
        <h2>{{sections.0}}</h2>
        <p>A couple of sentences about this section.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="sec-2">
        <h2>{{sections.1}}</h2>
        <p>A couple of sentences about this section.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="sec-3">
        <h2>{{sections.2}}</h2>
        <p>A couple of sentences about this section.</p>
      </section>

      <section id="offer">
        <h2>What we offer</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          {{#each items}}<article class="card">
            <h3>{{title}}</h3>
            <p>{{text}}</p>
            <p class="price">{{price}}</p>
          </article>
          {{/each}}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="inquiry">
        <h2>{{mainAction.label}}</h2>
        <form action="/inquiry" method="post">
          <p>
            <label for="f-name">What should we call you?</label><br>
            <input id="f-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required>
          </p>
          <p>
            <label for="f-phone">Phone</label><br>
            <input id="f-phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required>
          </p>
          <p><button type="submit">{{mainAction.label}}</button></p>
        </form>
      </section>
    </main>


    <section data-scaffold id="auth-plan">
      <h2>Does my site need sign-in</h2>
      <p id="need">Is sign-in needed: not needed for visitors. The project’s main action (“{{mainAction.label}}”) is an inquiry through a form, and it needs no sign-in: making an account for a single inquiry would be too much to ask of the audience. Only the owner needs to sign in, to edit the list of offerings.</p>
      <p id="method">Way to sign in: for the owner, a link sent by email, or a passkey, with no password; for visitors there is no sign-in.</p>
      <table>
        <tr><th>Role</th><th>What they can do</th></tr>
        <tr class="role"><td>Visitor</td><td class="can">looks at the pages and sends an inquiry through the form</td></tr>
        <tr class="role"><td>Owner</td><td class="can">sees the inquiries, edits the texts and the list of offerings, appoints editors</td></tr>
        <tr class="role"><td>Editor</td><td class="can">edits the page texts but does not see inquiries with personal data</td></tr>
      </table>
      <p id="passwords">Passwords: if passwords are needed after all, they are stored only as a hash (argon2id or bcrypt) with a salt, never as plain text; better still is passwordless sign-in, by a link or a passkey.</p>
      <p id="pd">Personal data at sign-in: an email address and a name are personal data under the GDPR: they need a lawful basis such as consent, and a privacy notice. Signing in with Google or by SMS is also processing of data, and the privacy notice says so.</p>
    </section>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <p>{{name}}, {{city}}</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
`,
				'styles.css': `/* styles.css: the page after the CSS part, in short */

*,
*::before,
*::after {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  font: 1.0625rem/1.6 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
  color: #1d2430;
  background-color: #ffffff;
}

main {
  max-width: 50rem;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
}

h1,
h2,
h3 {
  line-height: 1.2;
}

a {
  color: #1a4d8f;
}

nav ul {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 0.5rem 1rem;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  list-style: none;
}

.site-header {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
  padding: 1rem;
  color: #ffffff;
  background-color: #1a4d8f;
}

.site-header a {
  color: #ffffff;
}

.brand {
  margin: 0;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
}

.button {
  display: inline-block;
  min-height: 2.75rem;
  padding: 0.625rem 1.25rem;
  color: #ffffff;
  background-color: #1a4d8f;
  border-radius: 0.25rem;
  text-decoration: none;
}

.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem, 1fr));
  gap: 1rem;
}

.card {
  padding: 1rem;
  background-color: #f3f5f8;
  border-radius: 0.5rem;
}

.price {
  font-weight: 600;
}

input,
button {
  font: inherit;
}

